From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:02:13 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] netevent: Add the messages of the Event log service's events.

The event log service writes 6009 and 6005 as it starts and 6006 as it
stops, and nothing could tell what they say: EvtFormatMessage takes the
messages from the source's EventMessageFile, and the EventLog source
had none.  On Windows they are in netevent.dll; this one has the
messages of the service's events (6005, 6006, 6008, 6009, 6011, 6013)
as Windows 11 has them, in English and Simplified Chinese, and is the
message file of the EventLog source of the System log.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/configure b/configure
index 9c037ade9e3..0c1bbe8d522 100755
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1367,6 +1367,7 @@ enable_ndfapi
 enable_ndis_sys
 enable_netapi32
 enable_netcfgx
+enable_netevent
 enable_netio_sys
 enable_netprofm
 enable_netutils
@@ -22627,6 +22628,7 @@ wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netapi32 enable_netapi32
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netapi32/tests enable_tests
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netcfgx enable_netcfgx
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netcfgx/tests enable_tests
+wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netevent enable_netevent
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netio.sys enable_netio_sys
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netprofm enable_netprofm
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/netprofm/tests enable_tests
diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index cfe4c9c8f78..c71baee92c6 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -3054,6 +3054,7 @@ WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netapi32)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netapi32/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netcfgx)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netcfgx/tests)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netevent)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netio.sys)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netprofm)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/netprofm/tests)
diff --git a/dlls/netevent/Makefile.in b/dlls/netevent/Makefile.in
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..fc89745441f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/netevent/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+MODULE    = netevent.dll
+
+EXTRADLLFLAGS = -Wb,--data-only
