+LanguageNames=(ENU=0x409:netevent)
+SeverityNames=(Warning=0x2:STATUS_SEVERITY_WARNING)
+
+MessageId=6005
+Severity=Warning
+SymbolicName=EVENT_EventlogStarted
+Language=ENU
+The Event log service was started.
+.
+MessageId=6006
+Severity=Warning
+SymbolicName=EVENT_EventlogStopped
+Language=ENU
+The Event log service was stopped.
+.
+MessageId=6008
+Severity=Warning
+SymbolicName=EVENT_EventlogAbnormalShutdown
+Language=ENU
+The previous system shutdown at %1 on %2 was unexpected.
+.
+MessageId=6009
+Severity=Warning
+SymbolicName=EVENT_EventLogProductInfo
+Language=ENU
+Microsoft (R) Windows (R) %1 %2 %3 %4.
+.
+MessageId=6011
+Severity=Warning
+SymbolicName=EVENT_ComputerNameChange
+Language=ENU
+The NetBIOS name and DNS host name of this machine have been changed from %1 to %2.
+.
+MessageId=6013
+Severity=Warning
+SymbolicName=EVENT_EventLogUptime
+Language=ENU
